V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftLinear}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftLinear}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightLinear}\">\\(\\mathrm{RightLinear}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" href=\"?note=7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" title=\"56-df-left-linear\">56-df-left-linear</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715d126877a6c443\" href=\"?note=715d126877a6c443\" title=\"56-df-right-linear\">56-df-right-linear</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{RightLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Linear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{RightLinear}(\\Sigma,V,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把左右端线性合并为系统级缩写，不引入新的重写语义。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-left-linear","status":"resolved","id":"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b"